# CML objawy glass system (locked — reusable)

Dr Bujok: this symptom UI band is elegant and **permanent**. Copy it into other apps; do not reinvent marble tags, silver flares, or solid black question bars.

**Source implementation:** `public/cml/bmcml-a.html` (`#objawy` + CSS for `.objaw-group` / `.objaw-q-bar` / `.objaw-group-body` / `.objaw-tag`).

**Layout concept graphic:** `public/cml/objaw-kafelek-glowa.png` (+ `.webp`) — tile-with-head connector. Related refs: `objaw-pytanie-pasek.*`, `objaw-tag-glass.*` (exploration); live tags are CSS, not those bitmaps.

## Related prefs (documented elsewhere — do not break)

- Transparent **dark glass plates** are the working contrast system over depth / living-wall atmosphere (`cml-surgeon-direction.mdc`).
- Gold brand accent: `#C4A874`. Black / near-black frames. Prefer see-through glass over milky white or opaque cards.
- This symptom band is **reusable across applications**, not CML-only chrome.

---

## 1) Outer symptom accordion header (Ból, Krwawienie, …)

Thick transparent dark glass on the **`<button>` itself** — not a thin strip.

| Token | Locked value |
|-------|----------------|
| Padding | `28px 24px` |
| Min-height | `~80px` |
| Blur | `backdrop-filter: blur(10px) saturate(160%)` — strong but still see-through |
| Fill | Light glass wash: `radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(20,20,20,.018) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.033) 100%)` |
| Label | Large (~`26px`), serif family as in CML (`Cormorant Garamond`) |
| Subtitle | Exact copy: **Stuknij aby rozwinąć** (~12px, muted gold/stone) |
| Chrome | Light edge / inset hairline (`border` + `box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.10)`); no heavy glow |

Icon circle + chevron stay secondary; the **category name** is the standout.

---

## 1b) From `#leczenie` down — same light glass wash (global)

Approved standard for glass plates / cards / CTA buttons **from `#leczenie` onward** (treatment intro, treatment cards, opinions, `#kontakt` form + buttons). Do **not** restyle `#objawy`, `#wizyta`, or screens 1–2.

| Token | Locked value |
|-------|----------------|
| Fill | `radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(20,20,20,.018) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.033) 100%)` |
| Blur | `backdrop-filter: blur(10px) saturate(160%)` (+ `-webkit-` twin) |
| Edge | Light border `rgba(255,255,255,.20)` + inset hairline `inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.10)` |

Match **transparency / shade / border language** — not the symptom header’s ~80px height. Gold CTA borders (`#C4A874` / `rgba(196,168,116,.45)`) stay on kontakt actions.

